OL,3,ALock of former US President George
OL,4,AWashington's hair sells for $4,000
OL,5,
OL,6,FA framed lock of hair from America's
OL,7,Ffirst president, George Washington, has
OL,8,Fbeen sold at auction for $4,000
OL,9,F(#3,058).
OL,11,FThe hair once belonged to John Gadsby,
OL,12,Fwho entertained Washington in 1799 just
OL,13,Fbefore the latter's death the same
OL,14,Fyear, and was later obtained by a
OL,15,Fcollector called John K Lattimer from a
OL,16,Fdescendent of Gadsby's, according to
OL,17,FRichmond Auctions, which sold the item.
OL,19,FIts new owner has not been named.
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
