OL,3,ALock of former US President George
OL,4,AWashington's hair sells for $4,000
OL,5,
OL,6,FSaturday's sale is not the most
OL,7,Fexpensive for Washington hair at
OL,8,Fauction. Three strands thought to have
OL,9,Fbeen removed from him close to or after
OL,10,Fhis death stored in a locket sold for
OL,11,Fnearly $40,000 in 2021.
